  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Bug Fixes\n\nFixed duplicate date change events when changing selected date/time values in:\n\n* `PersianCalendarWithClock`\n* `PersianDatePicker`\n* `PersianDateTimePicker`\n\nAlso improved synchronization between the public properties and the internal calendar/clock controls.\n\n\nThis release introduces a fully standardized and reliable wheel interaction model for the Clock control:\n\n- **Ctrl** now adjusts the hour\n- **Shift** adjusts the minute\n- **Ctrl + Shift** adjusts the second\n- Removed **Alt** modifier usage due to WPF AccessKey/MenuMode conflicts\n- Improved consistency of wheel behavior when interacting with the Canvas surface\n- Internal refactoring for cleaner logic and easier future extension\n\nThese changes provide a more predictable and professional user experience while maintaining backward compatibility with existing applications.\n\n\nModern1 style fix:  \nSelected holiday dates now display correctly. Visual state handling for holiday/selected cells has been updated for consistent rendering.",
